{"product_id":"jacqueline-wilsons-super-stars-the-suitcase-kid-and-the-lottie-project","title":"Jacqueline Wilson's Super Stars: The Suitcase Kid and The Lottie Project","description":"\u003cp\u003eTwo of Jacqueline Wilson's most well-loved stories.Two of Jacqueline Wilson's most popular stories together in one fantastic collection.In The Suitcase Kid, Andy is struggling to cope with her parents' divorce: one week with Mum, one week with Dad. But all she wants is to go back to how things were before.Winner of the Children's Book AwardIn The Lottie Project, Charlie invents a Victorian servant girl as part of her school project. Lottie's life was very hard, but the two might have more in common that Charlie realised.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 127 x 198\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Jacqueline Wilson\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780440864554\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 368\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45898400399513,"sku":"17RE-2-9780440864554","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/691822857132c_Jacqueline_Wilson_s_Super_Stars_The_Suitcase_Kid_and_The_Lottie_Project.jpg?v=1763202659","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/jacqueline-wilsons-super-stars-the-suitcase-kid-and-the-lottie-project","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}